Package: adlaplaceHgp
Type: Package
Title: Hierarchical Gaussian Processes for 'adlaplace'
Version: 0.5.4
Authors@R: person(given = "Patrick", family = "Brown",
    email = "patrick.borgnine@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Hierarchical and random-slope integrated Wiener process model terms
    for use with the adlaplace Laplace approximation framework. Provides
    hiwp, rsiwp, rsiid, rsfpoly, and rsrpoly constructors plus conditional
    simulation utilities for IWP-style smooths.
